tive-sessions-heading" style="font: var(--lc-type-heading-3);">Active sessions</h2><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap border border-[var(--lc-border-strong)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap px-4 py-2" type="button">Sign out everywhere except this device</button></div><ul class="divide-y divide-[var(--lc-border)]"><li class="flex items-center gap-[var(--lc-space-md)] py-[var(--lc-space-md)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-monitor h-6 w-6" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="3" rx="2"></rect><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="21" y2="21"></line><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="17" y2="21"></line></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p>Chrome on macOS</p><p class="text-[length:var(--lc-type-body-sm)] text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]">Dubai, UAE · Last active 2 minutes ago</p></div><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-status-published-bg)] text-[var(--lc-status-published-fg)]">This device</div></li><li class="flex items-center gap-[var(--lc-space-md)] py-[var(--lc-space-md)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-smartphone h-6 w-6" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M12 18h.01"></path></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p>Safari on iPhone</p><p class="text-[length:var(--lc-type-body-sm)] text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]">Abu Dhabi, UAE · Last active 1 day ago</p></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap border border-[var(--lc-border-strong)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap px-4 py-2" type="button">Sign out</button></li></ul></section></div></main></div></div></div><div role="region" aria-label="Notifications (F8)" tabindex="-1" style="pointer-events: none;"><ol tabindex="-1" class="fixed top-0 z-toast flex max-w-[420px] flex-col gap-2 p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]"></ol></div>
